WEBVTT

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:01.320
Select the KET scheme and click [Copy SVG] on the [SMILES] ribbon.

00:00:01.350 --> 00:00:01.720
Paste the scalable SVG graphic onto the slide and run Convert to Shape.

00:00:01.750 --> 00:00:03.000
Converted SVG paths are now native PowerPoint vector shapes—recolored and grouped by stage for animation.

